<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Karsalana Lab — Jasa Pembuatan Website & Web App</title>
    <!-- Google Fonts: Inter -->
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        /* CSS Variables untuk Light & Dark Mode */
        :root {
            --bg-color: #f8fafc;
            --card-bg: #ffffff;
            --text-main: #0f172a;
            --text-muted: #64748b;
            --primary: #3b82f6; /* Warna biru cerah/medium menyesuaikan logo */
            --primary-dark: #1e3a8a; /* Biru tua khas logo Karsalana */
            --border-color: #e2e8f0;
            --shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05), 0 2px 4px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03);
            --header-bg: rgba(248, 250, 252, 0.85);
        }

        @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
            :root {
                --bg-color: #0f172a;
                --card-bg: #1e293b;
                --text-main: #ffffff; /* Dark mode full putih bersih */
                --text-muted: #94a3b8;
                --primary: #60a5fa;
                --primary-dark: #3b82f6;
                --border-color: #334155;
                --shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
                --header-bg: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.85);
            }
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            transition: background-color 0.3s ease, color 0.3s ease, border-color 0.3s ease;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            color: var(--text-main);
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* Header / Navbar */
        header {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            background-color: var(--header-bg);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            z-index: 1000;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 1rem 5%;
        }

        .logo-container {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .logo-container img {
            height: 36px;
            width: auto;
        }

        .logo-text {
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            color: var(--text-main);
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
        }

        .logo-text span {
            color: var(--primary);
        }

        nav a {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            text-decoration: none;
            margin-left: 24px;
            font-weight: 500;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }

        nav a:hover {
            color: var(--text-main);
        }

        /* Hero Section */
        .hero {
            padding: 140px 5% 80px 5%;
            text-align: center;
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .badge {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.1);
            color: var(--primary);
            padding: 6px 14px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4vw, 3.2rem);
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: -1px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            color: var(--text-main);
        }

        .hero p {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            margin-bottom: 35px;
        }

        .btn-primary {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: var(--primary-dark);
            color: #ffffff;
            padding: 12px 28px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(30, 58, 138, 0.3);
            transition: transform 0.2s, opacity 0.2s;
        }

        .btn-primary:hover {
            opacity: 0.9;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        /* Section Container */
        .container {
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 60px 5%;
        }

        .section-title {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        .section-title h2 {
            font-size: 2rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .section-title p {
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }

        /* Grid Showcase / Demo Web */
        .grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));
            gap: 24px;
        }

        .card {
            background-color: var(--card-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 30px;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: space-between;
        }

        .card h3 {
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            color: var(--text-main);
        }

        .card p {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }

        .card-footer {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            padding-top: 16px;
        }

        .tag {
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            background-color: rgba(100, 116, 139, 0.1);
            color: var(--text-muted);
            padding: 4px 10px;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }

        .btn-secondary {
            color: var(--primary);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }

        .btn-secondary:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        /* Footer */
        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 40px 5%;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        /* Responsive */
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            nav { display: none; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- Header / Navbar -->
    <header>
        <a href="#" class="logo-container">
            <!-- Letakkan file Karsalana.png sejajar dengan index.html atau ubah path src-nya -->
            <img src="Karsalana.png" alt="Karsalana Logo">
            <span class="logo-text">Karsalana<span>.Lab</span></span>
        </a>
        <nav>
            <a href="#demos">Live Demos</a>
            <a href="#services">Layanan</a>
            <a href="https://wa.me/" target="_blank">Kontak</a>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="hero">
        <span class="badge">🚀 Karsalana Lab Development</span>
        <h1>Solusi Pembuatan Website Profesional & Fungsional</h1>
        <p>Wujudkan sistem digital, profil bisnis, atau aplikasi web interaktif untuk bisnismu dengan performa tinggi dan desain rapi.</p>
        <a href="#demos" class="btn-primary">Jelajahi Demo Aplikasi</a>
    </section>

    <!-- Showcase / Demo Section -->
    <section id="demos" class="container">
        <div class="section-title">
            <h2>Live Demo & Proyek Web</h2>
            <p>Coba langsung aplikasi web interaktif yang siap diimplementasikan untuk kebutuhanmu.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid">
            <!-- Card Demo 1: E-Menu -->
            <div class="card">
                <div>
                    <h3>Digital E-Menu & Resto</h3>
                    <p>Sistem katalog menu digital interaktif berbasis web untuk restoran atau kafe. Pelanggan bisa langsung pesan melalui perangkat mereka.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="card-footer">
                    <span class="tag">Web App</span>
                    <!-- Mengarah ke sub-folder sesuai rencanamu -->
                    <a href="./e-menu/demo" class="btn-secondary">Coba Demo &rarr;</a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Card Demo 2: Undangan Digital -->
            <div class="card">
                <div>
                    <h3>Undangan Digital Eksklusif</h3>
                    <p>Website undangan pernikahan atau acara dengan fitur RSVP, hitung mundur, pemutar musik latar, dan kontrol akses tamu undangan.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="card-footer">
                    <span class="tag">Invitation</span>
                    <a href="./undangan/demo" class="btn-secondary">Coba Demo &rarr;</a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Card Demo 3: Company Profile -->
            <div class="card">
                <div>
                    <h3>Company Profile & Katalog</h3>
                    <p>Situs profil perusahaan yang bersih, cepat, responsif di semua perangkat, serta dioptimalkan untuk mesin pencari (SEO).</p>
                </div>
                <div class="card-footer">
                    <span class="tag">Business</span>
                    <a href="./company/demo" class="btn-secondary">Coba Demo &rarr;</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2026 Karsalana Lab. Seluruh hak cipta dilindungi.</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
